  "description": {
    "raw": "A skirt, kilt, or gown you are wearing enables you to control your falls through the air. A creature wearing the enchanted item of clothing falls slowly as if affected by feather fall and can attempt a DC 15 Fly skill check as a move action to hover in place for 1 round.",
    "search_text": "\"a skirt, kilt, or gown you are wearing enables you to control your falls through the air. a creature wearing the enchanted item of clothing falls slowly as if affected by feather fall and can attempt a dc 15 fly skill check as a move action to hover in place for 1 round.\"",
